# PhysRealFlow scene
# The Midas touch: plain shapes turned into several physics models that act on each other -
# two magnets pull together, a box flies trailing smoke, a cotton curtain hangs over a hot spot
# and catches fire, a jelly ball bounces. Open it in the editor: "Сцена" -> "Открыть…".
world gravity 0 -9.81 0 size 4 3 4 gas 1 magneticGas 0
entity "Пол"
  object id 1 visible 1 locked 1
  shape plane size 4 0.02 4 position 0 0.01 0 rotation 0 0 0 color 0.52 0.55 0.6
  rigid density 500 friction 0.5 restitution 0.2 fixed 1 velocity 0 0 0 spin 0 0 0
end
entity "Магнит A"
  object id 2 visible 1 locked 0
  shape box size 0.14 0.07 0.07 position -0.55 0.2 -0.35 rotation 0 0 0 color 0.85 0.2 0.2
  rigid density 7500 friction 0.3 restitution 0.2 fixed 0 velocity 0 0 0 spin 0 0 0
  magnet moment 3 0 0
end
